<title>PERU: Peru's Cervesur 11-mo net falls. [CORRECTED 19:57 GMT]</title>
<headline>Peru's Cervesur 11-mo net falls. [CORRECTED 19:57 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending Novemeber 30.</p>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 15.9 million soles vs 26.1 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 215.1 million soles vs 144.2 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Compania Cervecera del Sur del Peru SA (Cervesur) is the country's second biggest brewery.</p>
<p>(Corrects to make clear that company is not part of the Backus group.)</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
